.SH HISTORY
.IX Header "HISTORY"
\&\fBEVP_MD_CTX\fR became opaque in OpenSSL 1.1.  Consequently, stack
allocated \fBEVP_MD_CTX\fRs are no longer supported.
.PP
\&\fBEVP_MD_CTX_create()\fR and \fBEVP_MD_CTX_destroy()\fR were renamed to
\&\fBEVP_MD_CTX_new()\fR and \fBEVP_MD_CTX_free()\fR in OpenSSL 1.1.
.PP
The link between digests and signing algorithms was fixed in OpenSSL 1.0 and
later, so now \fBEVP_sha1()\fR can be used with RSA and DSA. The legacy \fBEVP_dss1()\fR
was removed in OpenSSL 1.1.0
